{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-02-17 14:30:00', 'title': 'KROGER FULFILLMENT NETWORK EXPANDS TO OKLAHOMA CITY, OKLAHOMA', 'text': "OKLAHOMA CITY, FEB. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL OFFER MORE AMERICANS\xa0DELIVERY THROUGH THE ADDITION OF A SPOKE FACILITY IN\xa0OKLAHOMA CITY POWERED BY THE OCADO GROUP (LSE: OCDO). AS A CONTINUATION OF KROGER'S SUCCESSFUL ENTRY INTO FLORIDA IN 2021, OKLAHOMA WILL SERVE AS ANOTHER NEW GEOGRAPHY FOR THE COMPANY, BRINGING INNOVATION AND MODERN E-COMMERCE TO THE AREA, EXTENDING THE GROCER'S REACH AND ABILITY TO PROVIDE ITS CUSTOMERS ANYTHING, ANYTIME, ANYWHERE."}